nt_title_status":""},"say:7:1110301006:1":{"text":"——乌尔氏族的弱者，快滚回家吧！战歌节不欢迎你们！","source_cn":"——乌尔氏族的弱者，快滚回家吧！战歌节不欢迎你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x844C0454CAFAA5C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110301007:1":{"text":"这是……怎么回事？","source_cn":"这是……怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5C32ABBFA42384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110301008:1":{"text":"呵！你们不知道自己赔率多离谱吗？光是能从赤沙蛛域回来，就已经有人输掉裤子了！","source_cn":"呵！你们不知道自己赔率多离谱吗？光是能从赤沙蛛域回来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60518600A2ADC5C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110301009:1":{"text":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他们付出代价。","source_cn":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB96B0B6D70C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110301009":{"text":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他们付出代价。","source_cn":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他们付出代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB96B0B6D70C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110301010:1":{"text":"我没生气。总有一天，整片沙漠都会知道，乌尔氏族不可小觑…